OL,3,GNEWSACharity appeal as community hub
OL,4,Afaces 'challenges'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity which runs a community hub
OL,7,Fin Oxted is searching for new trustees
OL,8,Fand volunteers to help make the
OL,9,Fbuilding a success.
OL,11,FMaster Park Pavilion Charity opened a
OL,12,Fnew facility in the Surrey park just
OL,13,Fover a year ago following a #3.2m
OL,14,Frevamp which created a cafe, accessible
OL,15,Fpublic facilities and spaces for
OL,16,Fclasses and workshops.
OL,18,FThis new hub, created to provide an
OL,19,Fincome stream for the charity-owned
OL,20,Fpark, has encountered challenges since
OL,21,Fopening.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
