OL,3,GNEWSACharity appeal as community hub
OL,4,Afaces 'challenges'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Morgan, chair of the trustees,
OL,7,Fadmitted there wasn't a full
OL,8,Fappreciation of the "operational
OL,9,Fchallenges" as "we came out of
OL,10,F'construction and build mode' into 'run
OL,11,Fmode'".
